#################################
##	Sample of Behavior file

Behavior

FadeInLength		55
FadeOutLength		55

PYRrotate		30 0 0
PositionOffset		-.2 .1 0.05

Scale			1.5 1.0 1.0		
ScaleRate		1.015 1.015 1.015
EndScale		2.0 1.5 1.5

 Stretch		0  ## 0 = No Stretch, 1 = Stretch to Lookat, 2 = Stretch to lookat and tile   		

Alpha			170

End


